          "repository": "notasithlord/peerd",
          "url": "https://github.com/NotASithLord/peerd/blob/12d1a54976bc07c4c8a4e9875f694964bd3a65b3/README.md#L148-L149"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3c8c64748de02c48cd36088f3f422287147dcca34560e0adbfac0807b63fe178",
        "slc_a835bff28e62378118fdbfeb51f76c9fdcd3eb48a4644af23fe7e7419cccb204"
      ],
      "text": "The extension has five main modules, each exposing its public API via index.js: peerd-provider (model adapters), peerd-egress (vault, network policy, denylist, audit), peerd-engine (WebVM/Notebook/App/headless execution), peerd-runtime (agent loop, actors, tools, sessions, memory, permissions), and peerd-distributed (preview-only P2P)."
    },
