      ],
      "text": "Apps integrate via window.peerd APIs: agent.open() reveals a trusted drawer only during real user activation, agent.expose() declares observe/act semantic adapters, and peerd.data provides bounded JSON persistence (1 MB per write) mapped to data/<key>.json in the App's working tree."
    },
