      "text": "On Firefox, WebVM cannot boot from an extension page, threaded WebAssembly is unavailable, the Pod 'js' command is refused, Apps are disabled pending Firefox 154 adoption, offscreen-hosted tools are absent or degraded, and CDP-only automation features fall back to chrome.scripting."
