        "slc_eb30c6b0a3088f686027748fbcfa0b9dee595e86ea83d368d158d001589beb85"
      ],
      "text": "Documented residual egress limits: Chrome DNR does not intercept worker-created WebSockets, private-network classification is lexical (no DNS resolution, so DNS rebinding is outside the check), and query strings/fragments are not a complete DLP boundary."
    },
