        "slc_bf4c3ff489ae02b4c2a1d181bb299ece8ae7ba071c23dbdfaad7a84c98e0c9c5"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: development uses Bun commands (bun install, gen:dev, test, typecheck, lint, e2e:verify, preflight) across three test surfaces (Bun unit tests, in-browser Chrome/Gecko tests, live Chrome E2E), plus a red-team suite; generated files like extension/manifest.json must not be hand-edited and CI checks them for drift."
    },
