          "repository": "notasithlord/peerd",
          "url": "https://github.com/NotASithLord/peerd/blob/12d1a54976bc07c4c8a4e9875f694964bd3a65b3/README.md#L166-L172"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_57108e1f8376c4fb98caeb9013bd56547822349c3bb27beb5790a9a314bb32cf"
      ],
      "text": "The source extension is vanilla JavaScript with ES modules running directly when loaded unpacked, with no development bundler or transpiler; release packaging with Bun minifies only a disposable staging copy and preserves module boundaries and vendored bytes."
    }
